521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 248 0 R
/T (21's are where you divide each set into 7 mini repetitions. You do 7 partial repetitions in the bottom range of the movement, then with no rest into the top range of the movement for 7 partials, and then finally, the entire repetition for 7 full repetitions, totalling 21 total repetitions \(21's\). Apply this technique to the exercises marked with the green ticks. You will have to use a lower weight than you are used to.)
/E (21's are where you divide each set into 7 mini repetitions. You do 7 partial repetitions in the bottom range of the movement, then with no rest into the top range of the movement for 7 partials, and then finally, the entire repetition for 7 full repetitions, totalling 21 total repetitions \(21's\). Apply this technique to the exercises marked with the green ticks. You will have to use a lower weight than you are used to.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
