583 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 252 0 R
/T (Partial reps are performed in the lower 25% of the range of motion: short, controlled pulses that maintain constant tension in the muscle. They are used at the end of a set, when full reps are no longer possible, to maximize muscle fatigue. This month, after reaching muscle failure in the marked exercises, perform 3 to 5 partial reps before lowering the weight. You can also perform partial reps with each rep of your set, doing 3 partial reps for every repetition. Try both methods often!)
/E (Partial reps are performed in the lower 25% of the range of motion: short, controlled pulses that maintain constant tension in the muscle. They are used at the end of a set, when full reps are no longer possible, to maximize muscle fatigue. This month, after reaching muscle failure in the marked exercises, perform 3 to 5 partial reps before lowering the weight. You can also perform partial reps with each rep of your set, doing 3 partial reps for every repetition. Try both methods often!)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
