/T (Theres always a PR \(Personal Record\) to hit, but you need to be in the gym to hit it, enjoying yourself, and being able to know the options available to you based on different situations. It is important to have knowledge so you can find what you love in fitness, and awareness of when to make a change. Some people may love just one sport and style of workout their whole life, and others need variety. Some people get injured doing one style of workout for too long and need to make substitutions or slight programme changes to stay active .)
