/Title (21's are where you divide each set into 7 mini repetitions. You do 7 partial repetitions in the bottom range of the movement, then with no rest into the top range of the movement for 7 partials, and then finally, the entire repetition for 7 full repetitions, totalling 21 total repetitions \(21's\). Apply this technique to the exercises marked with the green ticks. You will have to use a lower weight than you are used to.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3836 0 R
