3956 0 obj
<<
/Title (Partial reps are performed in the lower 25% of the range of motion: short, controlled pulses that maintain constant tension in the muscle. They are used at the end of a set, when full reps are no longer possible, to maximize muscle fatigue. This month, after reaching muscle failure in the marked exercises, perform 3 to 5 partial reps before lowering the weight. You can also perform partial reps with each rep of your set, doing 3 partial reps for every repetition. Try both methods often!)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3933 0 R
/Next 3957 0 R
